{"c":[{"id":"e0aca5420853595c","sum":"Human pages omit semantic --harness/--role (flag home: sr-semantic SKILL.md). Claude message tokens stored once per (message.id, requestId), field-wise max; subagent copies of a parent response carry none; vanished transcripts are not rewritten.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T220128Z-48f450097d0ca431","text":"Human pages do not list semantic --harness or --role. Flag home is skills/sr-semantic/SKILL.md; the sr-search route row and the two-path sentence stay.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261009T164010Z-c6c38050580988bb","text":"Claude message tokens are stored once per (message.id, requestId), field-wise max; a subagent copy of a parent response carries none. Transcripts that are gone are not rewritten.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"7fd1420334a977b2","sum":"Vanished Claude token rows stay stored (message.id/requestId never persisted; gaps between equal cache triples occur in one response). Cursor CLI subagent children: meta.subagentInfo parentAgentId, toolCallId, typeName; spawn is CallDynamicTool namespace=cursor toolName=Task.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261009T193126Z-43be936f55bee97c","text":"Vanished Claude token rows stay stored: message.id and requestId were never persisted, and a user row or time gap between equal cache triples also occurs inside one response.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261016T014749Z-e1cebfcb88bd6cfa","text":"Cursor CLI subagents: child meta.subagentInfo has parentAgentId, toolCallId, typeName. Parent spawn is CallDynamicTool args namespace=cursor toolName=Task, not a tool named Task. CLI ingest ignores subagentInfo, so no dashboard inset.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
